{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/2/desc","kr_sha":"b1e26c9aed60f09c74de7388a937abb8828694cb302ba6676684d9a597cd5926","zh":"若部位陷入<color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>混亂狀態</color></mark></b></u>，則移除其他部位<color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>各1個混亂閾值並結束回合</color></mark></b></u>\n之後於下回合使所有部位獲得 [HideBlackYarn]\n\n若<color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>[HideBlackYarn] 因受到攻擊而消失</color></mark></b></u>，\n- 使自身獲得10層 [SickBlackYarn]\n- 若獲得的 [SickBlackYarn] 超過最大值，則本回合與下回合使自身獲得3層易損\n\n回合結束時，若 [HideBlackYarn] 已消失，\n- 使自身獲得(7-剩餘強度)層 [SickBlackYarn]\n- 下回合使自身獲得1層 [AngryBlackYarn]","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
