{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/12/desc","kr_sha":"07c59b79e7ff7812b6e70f5bb4781fceb73926296925e59d74b70cbbc8e79353","zh":"回合開始時，對上回合<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>對自身造成最多傷害的罪人</u></b></mark></color>\n<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>施加1層 [TailoringTarget]</u></b></mark></color>並使用「製作版型」\n- 若帶有 [TailoringTarget] 的罪人<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>帶有9層 [ScissorsMark]</u></b></mark></color>，\n則「製作版型」改為以<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>「鏈式包縫」</u></b></mark></color>發動\n\n每當自身受到罪人攻擊時，\n- 對該罪人施加1層 [ScissorsMark] (每名罪人每回合最多5層)\n- 使自身的 [ChargeKhaki] 回數增加1回(每名罪人每回合最多5回)\n\n<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>每當自身受到帶有 [TailoringTarget] 的罪人以攻擊技能攻擊時，\n使自身獲得3層 [ResultEnhancement] (每回合最多9層)</u></b></mark></color>","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/12/flavor","kr_sha":"8a364facb42a33273538374413b188a7230f4d1e9e50f523dbc03db444fa911e","zh":"人們常說，衣服要經過修補才算完成。除非是量身訂做的衣服，否則都得透過修補，讓它逐漸合乎自己的身形。\n\n而這並不僅限於衣服。從外界得來的東西，同樣要經過修補再披上，才能合乎自己的心意，穿著它活下去。","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/12/name","kr_sha":"9de1ff063d395642a84d01cfc1a838b3d6af5e098a2774869c14bb4d4cd103f1","zh":"修補","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/13/desc","kr_sha":"9b809c8bf93e4c11263dc094bab6a01af70c1a009d091d663bf5449696cb7e46","zh":"關卡開始時，或脫離混亂狀態後的回合開始時，\n使自身獲得30層 [FinishedFabric]\n\n自身受到 [PanicChangeLock] 效果影響，\n回合結束時，若自身陷入恐慌，則理智值變為30\n\n回合開始時，\n- 使自身獲得<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>自身體力上限([FinishedFabric] 層數)%的護盾</u></b></mark></color>(最多30%)\n- 使自身恢復等同於 [FinishedFabric] 層數的理智值","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/13/flavor","kr_sha":"7d435ead15128788412f061cdea6c4aea14f773f2b876b1203c0ed16b5c24417","zh":"裁剪，是依照版型剪裁布料。如果說修補是讓衣服合乎人的過程，那麼裁剪就是讓布料合乎衣服的過程。\n\n因此對布料而言，裁剪就等同於修補。一經剪下的布料會保留本身的性質，被牢牢釘定為修補達人所設想的一件衣服。","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/13/name","kr_sha":"98b42aa9c6b28fa867eff93d970ed649a35a373e4dd77455479e755f986d9012","zh":"裁剪","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1d38104f7d6ccb709e61d61417c0182cce5e8f44","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T083844-4603fb3b"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/14/desc","kr_sha":"fab01288fea73cef7c0aa5c1e0ae185b327f7beef04c17086292d54767091be6","zh":"修補達人 安妮特\n- <color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>每當受到罪人攻擊時，使自身的混亂閾值前移體力上限0.8%的量</u></b></mark></color>\n\n<color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>若自身陷入混亂，\n則失去自身所有護盾、[FinishedFabric] 與 [LargeTailoringShears]，並使自身獲得3層 [Vulnerable]</u></b></mark></color>\n\n回合開始時，若自身體力不高於60%，\n- 自身每失去20%體力，則使自身獲得1層 [ResultEnhancement] 與1層 [SlashDamageUp] (各最多3層)\n- 「鑲邊」的最後一枚硬幣與「裁剪」的第二枚硬幣轉變為 [SuperCoin]","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-a1c10p2.json|/dataList/14/flavor","kr_sha":"aee5874e54f1615b1440b5e852ce6da1595269413699f1a8ff8c21c10d1377a0","zh":"以修補為價值而形成的身軀，為了無止盡地修補與裁剪，剪刀始終不曾停下。\n\n即使身軀逐漸崩壞，也斷不了修補與裁剪。明明做著剪斷的工作，自己卻偏偏斷不了。","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081441-15baa94b"}
